<LanguageData>
  <!-- Techno Bit -->
  <!--原中文: '哔哔小子', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Techno-Bit',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Techno-Bit-->
  <TM_TechnoBit.label>哔哔小子</TM_TechnoBit.label>
  <!--原中文: '哔哔小子全称“个人信息处理器”，是一个小型的、智能的穿戴式电子设备，它能在许多任务中帮助机械师，提供额外的支持。哔哔小子辅助可以自由切换，在禁用时不会执行任何任务。\n  \n未启动:哔哔小子协助加工、采矿和建筑任务。它还将修复附近的建筑、机器人和机械装置。\n\n启动:利用反重力系统推动小型延时炸药到达机械师的目标。对附近的机械单位或建筑物进行加速维修。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The techno-bit is a small, autonomous orb that assists the technomancer in many tasks and provides the technomancer with additional support capabilities. The techno-bit assist can be toggled and will not perform any task while disabled.
	
Undrafted: the techno-bit assists in crafting, mining and construction tasks. It will also repair nearby buildings, androids, and mechanoids.

Drafted: uses an internal focus-LED to fire micro lasers at the technomancers target. Performs accelerated repairs to nearby robotic pawns or buildings.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The techno-bit is a small, autonomous orb that assists the technomancer in many tasks and provides the technomancer with additional support capabilities. The techno-bit assist can be toggled and will not perform any task while disabled.
	
Undrafted: the techno-bit assists in crafting, mining and construction tasks. It will also repair nearby buildings, androids, and mechanoids.

Drafted: uses an internal focus-LED to fire micro lasers at the technomancers target. Performs accelerated repairs to nearby robotic pawns or buildings.-->
  <TM_TechnoBit.description>哔哔小子全称“个人信息处理器”，是一个小型的、智能的穿戴式电子设备，它能在许多任务中帮助机械师，提供额外的支持。哔哔小子辅助可以自由切换，在禁用时不会执行任何任务。\n  \n未启动:哔哔小子协助加工、采矿和建筑任务。它还将修复附近的建筑、机器人和机械装置。\n\n启动:利用反重力系统推动小型延时炸药到达机械师的目标。对附近的机械单位或建筑物进行加速维修。</TM_TechnoBit.description>
  <!-- Techno Turret -->
  <!--原中文: 'Mark-IV炮塔 ', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Mark-IV Turret',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Mark-IV Turret-->
  <TM_TechnoTurret.label>Mark-IV炮塔 </TM_TechnoTurret.label>
  <!--原中文: '部署并建立与Mark-IV武器系统连接的炮塔。任何动作都将破坏连接，使Mark-IV武器系统小型化.火箭和迫击炮每次射击消耗法力。\n  \nMark-IV会在受到严重伤害时自动小型化，并对任何与系统链接的单位产生反馈。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Deploys and establishes a neural link to the Mark-IV turret. The Mark-IV is remotely controlled by the caster. Rockets and mortars consume mana per shot.

The Mark-IV will automatically miniaturize itself when it takes critical damage and can cause neural feedback to the technomancer controlling the system.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Deploys and establishes a neural link to the Mark-IV turret. The Mark-IV is remotely controlled by the caster. Rockets and mortars consume mana per shot.

The Mark-IV will automatically miniaturize itself when it takes critical damage and can cause neural feedback to the technomancer controlling the system.-->
  <TM_TechnoTurret.description>部署并建立与Mark-IV武器系统连接的炮塔。任何动作都将破坏连接，使Mark-IV武器系统小型化.火箭和迫击炮每次射击消耗法力。\n  \nMark-IV会在受到严重伤害时自动小型化，并对任何与系统链接的单位产生反馈。</TM_TechnoTurret.description>
  <!-- Techno Weapon -->
  <!--原中文: '工程武器', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Engineer Weapon',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Engineer Weapon-->
  <TM_TechnoWeapon.label>工程武器</TM_TechnoWeapon.label>
  <!--原中文: '机械师应用他们的工程和魔法知识来创建现有武器的修改版本。这个武器是由法力塑造而成的，作为他们身体的延伸,被锁定在机械师身上。\n  \n因此,如果脱离机械师,武器将会瓦解。此武器将由机械师在创建后自动装备。\n\n机械师也可以使用改进的弹药和纳米兴奋剂来提高作战能力。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The technomancer applies their knowledge of engineering and magic to create a modified version of an existing weapon.  This weapon is molded out of raw mana and physically anchored to the technomancer as an extension of their body.
Because of this, the weapon will disintegrate if separated from the technomancer.  This weapon will be automatically equipped by the technomancer once created.

Weapon specialists also have access to modified ammunition and nano stimulants for improved combat capabilities.

To create a techno weapon: target a weapon on the ground. Targeted weapon must be ranged, with an industrial or higher tech level, and use standard firing action.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The technomancer applies their knowledge of engineering and magic to create a modified version of an existing weapon.  This weapon is molded out of raw mana and physically anchored to the technomancer as an extension of their body.
Because of this, the weapon will disintegrate if separated from the technomancer.  This weapon will be automatically equipped by the technomancer once created.

Weapon specialists also have access to modified ammunition and nano stimulants for improved combat capabilities.

To create a techno weapon: target a weapon on the ground. Targeted weapon must be ranged, with an industrial or higher tech level, and use standard firing action.-->
  <TM_TechnoWeapon.description>机械师应用他们的工程和魔法知识来创建现有武器的修改版本。这个武器是由法力塑造而成的，作为他们身体的延伸,被锁定在机械师身上。\n  \n因此,如果脱离机械师,武器将会瓦解。此武器将由机械师在创建后自动装备。\n\n机械师也可以使用改进的弹药和纳米兴奋剂来提高作战能力。</TM_TechnoWeapon.description>
  <!-- Nano Stimulant -->
  <!--原中文: '纳米兴奋剂', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Nano Stimulant',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Nano Stimulant-->
  <TM_NanoStimulant.label>纳米兴奋剂</TM_NanoStimulant.label>
  <!--原中文: '一种能暂时增强使用者战斗能力的纳米粒子。这种兴奋剂是由机械师根据自身独特的生物基因特别合成的。它不会让人上瘾，但对其他任何生物都是有害的。\n  \n纳米粒子由体内的法力和能量提供能量，会迅速导致疲劳。\n\n当纳米粒子燃烧殆尽时，它们会形成血小板来烧灼、止血甚至愈合小伤口。使用纳米兴奋剂会加速任何活跃的疾病或感染。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'An injection of nanites that temporarily enhances the combat capabilities of the user. This stimulant is specially synthesized by the technomancer for their own unique biological and genetic makeup. It isn't chemically addictive, but is harmful for any other pawn. 

The nanites are fueled by mana and energy within the body and will rapidly cause fatigue. 

When the nanites burn out, they will form platelets to cauterize and stop bleeding and even heal small wounds. Use of nano stimulants will accelerate any active disease or infection.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: An injection of nanites that temporarily enhances the combat capabilities of the user. This stimulant is specially synthesized by the technomancer for their own unique biological and genetic makeup. It isn't chemically addictive, but is harmful for any other pawn. 

The nanites are fueled by mana and energy within the body and will rapidly cause fatigue. 

When the nanites burn out, they will form platelets to cauterize and stop bleeding and even heal small wounds. Use of nano stimulants will accelerate any active disease or infection.-->
  <TM_NanoStimulant.description>一种能暂时增强使用者战斗能力的纳米粒子。这种兴奋剂是由机械师根据自身独特的生物基因特别合成的。它不会让人上瘾，但对其他任何生物都是有害的。\n  \n纳米粒子由体内的法力和能量提供能量，会迅速导致疲劳。\n\n当纳米粒子燃烧殆尽时，它们会形成血小板来烧灼、止血甚至愈合小伤口。使用纳米兴奋剂会加速任何活跃的疾病或感染。</TM_NanoStimulant.description>
  <!-- Techno Shield -->
  <!--原中文: 'AT力场', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Kinetic Shield',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Kinetic Shield-->
  <TM_TechnoShield.label>AT力场</TM_TechnoShield.label>
  <!--原中文: '将目标包围在一个能反转远程攻击的力场中，攻击越强越难反转且更有可能穿越力场。\n  \n反转涉及的能量由攻击造成的伤害量决定。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Surrounds the target in a kinetic field that repels inbound projectiles. The kinetic shield is able to deflect projectiles depending on their kinetic energy, heavier projectiles are more difficult to deflect and will penetrate low powered shields. 
		
The amount of kinetic energy involved in a deflection is determined by the amount of damage that would be caused by the projectile.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Surrounds the target in a kinetic field that repels inbound projectiles. The kinetic shield is able to deflect projectiles depending on their kinetic energy, heavier projectiles are more difficult to deflect and will penetrate low powered shields. 
		
The amount of kinetic energy involved in a deflection is determined by the amount of damage that would be caused by the projectile.-->
  <TM_TechnoShield.description>将目标包围在一个能反转远程攻击的力场中，攻击越强越难反转且更有可能穿越力场。\n  \n反转涉及的能量由攻击造成的伤害量决定。</TM_TechnoShield.description>
  <!-- Sabotage -->
